# TMF Official - Agent Rules

## Sau moi task quan trong, thuc hien 4 viec:

### 1. Auto Push GitHub
- Commit message bang tieng Viet, KHONG icon/emoji
- Quy trinh: git add . -> git commit -m "mo ta tieng Viet" -> git push
- Vi du: "Hoan thanh giao dien trang chu" (KHONG co icon)

### 2. Update Summary (docs/SUMMARY.md)
- Mo ta tong quan he thong, cac module da hoan thanh
- Tech stack, cau truc thu muc
- Muc dich: conversation khac doc file nay se hieu ro he thong

### 3. Nut Quy tac tren Web (RuleButton component)
- Moi Tab/Section tren web co nut quy tac
- Click nut hien modal giai thich section do: muc dich, cach su dung, du lieu
- Quy tac hien thi tren giao dien web, khong phai file rieng
- Luon update khi co thay doi logic/chuc nang

### 4. Update Code Rules (docs/CODE_RULES.md)
- Quy tac dat ten file, folder, component
- Quy tac code style, API endpoint naming
- Cac convention dang tuan thu
- Muc dich: task sau tuan thu, khong lam loan he thong

## Quy tac chung:
- Monorepo voi npm workspaces (packages/client, packages/server)
- Frontend: React + Vite + Tailwind CSS + Zustand
- Backend: Node.js + Express + MongoDB + Redis
- Database chay qua Docker Compose
- Tat ca commit message bang tieng Viet, khong emoji/icon

